The ReSTIR story's importance sampling on P's lights
====================================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 2's beats `c2-is-math` and `c2-ris-question`,
stage by stage as its stage (`stepOf "is" 14`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 14: each light of the math scenes' example world (examples.rs, the lab's
illustration: 24 lights above P, every one reaching it) as a pair of bars, above what it brings to P, below the
chance the cheap choice picks it (its share of the power); a light drawn and its estimate f / p on a line of estimates around the true total; p reshaped
toward f until every estimate is the total; two ways of drawing mixed with weights that sum to one; then the target,
its total, and the cheap choice that ignores P. The numbers are the example's (`exampleLights`): its lights move
and brighten as the story's cues move the room's (`lightPhase`, `lightIntensity`).

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The charts

The bars run across the left of the canvas, f above and p below, one slot per light.
$[# _x0 -6.4]
$[# _x1 2.2]
$[# _fBase 0.9]
$[# _pBase -1.7]
$[# _lineY -2.9]
$[# _lineX0 -6.4]
$[# _lineX1 2.2]
$[# _right [% {v2 4.7 0.0}]]

Fn([Int, Int], Box). The slot of light i of n, across the bars' width, from a baseline of height 0.
$[# {_slot i n}
    [# w {/ {- _x1 _x0} {float n}}]
    [# x {+ _x0 {* w {float i}}}]
    {box {v2 {+ x {* 0.15 w}} 0.0} {v2 {- {+ x w} {* 0.15 w}} 0.0}}]
Fn([String, Int, Int, Float, Float, Color, Float], List(Mob)). Light i's bar on the baseline `base`, `height` high.
$[# {_bar id i n base height color alpha}
    [# s {_slot i n}]
    {filled id
        {box {v2 {.x {.lo s}} base} {v2 {.x {.hi s}} {+ base {max height 0.0}}}}
        color
        alpha}]

Fn([List({brings: Float, share: Float})], Float). The total of what the lights bring.
$[# {_total lights} {fold lights 0.0 {^ {t l} {+ t {.brings l}}}}]
Fn([List({brings: Float, share: Float})], Float). The largest share.
$[# {_maxShare lights} {fold lights 0.000001 {^ {m l} {max m {.share l}}}}]

Fn([List(Float), Float], Int). The light a uniform number `u` picks by the shares' running sum: the share whose span
holds `u`, the same distribution as the alias table the lab draws its own lights from (alias.rs).
$[# {_pick shares u}
    [# starts {runningSums shares}]
    [# n {length shares}]
    {fold
        {range 0 n}
        {- n 1}
        {^ {found i} {!if {!and {= found {- n 1}} {< u {nth starts {+ i 1}}}}
            {min found i}
            found}}}]

The story's draws: eight lights picked by the cheap choice with the story's numbers.
$[# _draws 8]



The scene



A part whose figure follows the scene's values at `s` (the lights' bars, the draws' estimates).
$[# _Lights [% {Struct {'
    {Field "n" Int}
    {Field "shares" {List Float}}
    {Field "total" Float}
    {Field "draws" {List Int}}
    {Field "brings" {Fn {' Float} {List Float}}}
    {Field "pNow" {Fn {' Float} {List Float}}}
    {Field "ideal" {Fn {' Float} Float}}
    {Field "fHeight" {Fn {' Float} Float}}
    {Field "pHeight" {Fn {' Float Float} Float}}}}]]

Fn([_Lights], List(ScorePart)). A light drawn (stage 0 to 2): the first draw's bars lit, a marker above it, and its
estimate written f / p; gone at stage 6.
$[# {_drawnParts l}
    [# n {.n l}]
    [# i {head {.draws l}}]
    [# x {.x {boxCenter {_slot i n}}}]
    [# {_marker s}
        [# f {nth {{.brings l} s} i}]
        [# p {nth {{.pNow l} s} i}]
        {append
            {arrowLine "drawn"
                {v2 x 3.85}
                {v2 x {+ _fBase {+ {{.fHeight l} f} 0.1}}}
                accentColor
                3.0}
            {append
                {_bar "drawnF" i n _fBase {{.fHeight l} f} accentColor 1.0}
                {_bar "drawnP" i n _pBase {{.pHeight l} s p} accentColor 1.0}}}]
    [# {_formula s}
        [# f {nth {{.brings l} s} i}]
        [# p {nth {{.pNow l} s} i}]
        {moveTo
            {texParts "est" f"{\frac{\lit{1}{f(x)}}{\lit{2}{p(x)}} = \frac{\lit{3}{${short f}}}{\lit{4}{${short p}}} = \lit{5}{${short {over f p}}}}" 0.48 textColor
                {' "f" "p" "fv" "pv" "e"}
                {' targetColor pColor targetColor pColor estimateColor}}
            {add2 _right {v2 0.0 2.4}}}]
    {'
        {part "drawn" _marker {' {enterOver 0.6 0.4 fadeIn} {exitOver 5.6 0.4 fadeOut}}}
        {part "est" _formula {' {enterOver 1.0 0.8 write} {exitOver 5.6 0.4 fadeOut}}}}]

Fn([_Lights], List(ScorePart)). The line of estimates (stages 1 to 5): each draw's estimate f / p as a dot (the
first at stage 1, the others at 2), the true total marked, the dots sliding as p follows f (stage 3 to 4) and back;
a dot fades as its light's p goes to nothing (it would never be drawn). All leave at stage 5.
$[# {_estimateParts l}
    [# total {.total l}]
    [# far {* 4.0 total}]
    [# {_x e} {lerp _lineX0 _lineX1 {clamp {/ e far} 0.0 1.0}}]
    [# line {append
        {arrowLine "line" {v2 _lineX0 _lineY} {v2 {+ _lineX1 0.3} _lineY} textDimColor 2.0}
        {moveTo {tex "lineLabel" f"{\frac{f}{p}}" 0.42 estimateColor} {v2 {+ _lineX1 0.8} _lineY}}}]
    [# truth {append
        {dashedLine "truth"
            {v2 {_x total} {- _lineY 0.35}}
            {v2 {_x total} {+ _lineY 0.6}}
            totalColor
            2.5}
        {moveTo
            {tex "truthText" f"{\textstyle\sum f}" 0.42 totalColor}
            {v2 {_x total} {- _lineY 0.72}}}}]
    [# {_dot j} {^ {s}
        [# i {nth {.draws l} j}]
        [# p {nth {{.pNow l} s} i}]
        [# seen {clamp {/ p {max {nth {.shares l} i} 0.000001}} 0.0 1.0}]
        [# e {over {nth {{.brings l} s} i} p}]
        [# r {+ 0.07 {* 0.25 {sqrt {nth {.shares l} i}}}}]
        {faded {dotAt f"{dot${str j}}" {v2 {_x e} _lineY} r estimateColor} seen}}]
    [# {_leaves} {exitOver 5.0 0.5 fadeOut}]
    {append
        {'
            {part "line" {^ {s} line} {' {enterOver 1.0 0.4 create} {_leaves}}}
            {part "truth" {^ {s} truth} {' {enterOver 2.0 0.4 fadeIn} {_leaves}}}}
        {map
            {range 0 _draws}
            {^ {j} {part f"{dot${str j}}"
                {_dot j}
                {'
                    {!if {= j 0}
                        {enterOver 1.4 0.4 fadeIn}
                        {enterOver {+ 2.0 {* 0.08 {float j}}} 0.3 fadeIn}}
                    {_leaves}}}}}}]

Fn([_Lights], List(ScorePart)). Mixing two ways of drawing (stages 5 to 6): a second way, every light alike, shown
flat over the p bars, and each light's two weights stacked to one (the balance heuristic's, one choice of weights
that sum to one); gone at stage 7.
$[# {_mixingParts l}
    [# n {.n l}]
    [# flat {/ 1.0 {float n}}]
    [# {_flatLine s} {dashedLine "flat"
        {v2 _x0 {+ _pBase {{.pHeight l} s flat}}}
        {v2 _x1 {+ _pBase {{.pHeight l} s flat}}}
        textColor
        2.0}]
    [# base -3.5]
    [# stacks {flatten {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i}
            [# p {nth {.shares l} i}]
            [# m {/ p {+ p flat}}]
            [# slot {_slot i n}]
            {append
                {filled f"{m1${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {.x {.lo slot}} base} {v2 {.x {.hi slot}} {+ base m}}}
                    pColor
                    0.85}
                {filled f"{m2${str i}}"
                    {box {v2 {.x {.lo slot}} {+ base m}} {v2 {.x {.hi slot}} {+ base 1.0}}}
                    textDimColor
                    0.6}}}}}]
    [# formula {moveTo
        {tex "mis" f"{m_1(x) + m_2(x) = 1}" 0.44 textColor}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -3.0}}}]
    [# {_leaves} {exitOver 6.0 0.4 fadeOut}]
    {'
        {part "flat" _flatLine {' {enterOver 5.0 0.4 create} {_leaves}}}
        {part "stacks" {^ {s} stacks} {' {enterOver 5.4 0.5 growUp} {_leaves}}}
        {part "mis" {^ {s} formula} {' {enterOver 5.5 0.4 write} {_leaves}}}}]

Fn([Float], List(ScorePart)). The target (stages 11 to 13): the totals (the target's is not one), and the exact
proportion, its sum struck out; gone at stage 13. (The ideal p, f's shares, is the p bars reshaped and in the
target's colour, stages 7 to 12.)
$[# {_targetParts total}
    [# sums {flatten {'
        {moveTo
            {tex "sumF" f"{\textstyle\sum \hat p = ${short total}}" 0.44 targetColor}
            {add2 _right {v2 0.0 2.3}}}
        {moveTo {tex "sumP" f"{\textstyle\sum p = 1}" 0.44 pColor} {add2 _right {v2 0.0 -0.9}}}}}]
    [# exact {moveTo
        {texParts "exact" f"{\frac{\hat p(x)}{\lit{1}{\textstyle\sum \hat p}}}" 0.5 textColor
            {' "sum"}
            {' targetColor}}
        {add2 _right {v2 0.0 0.8}}}]
    {'
        {part "sums" {^ {s} sums} {' {enterOver 10.0 0.7 write} {exitOver 12.6 0.4 fadeOut}}}
        {part "exact"
            {^ {s} exact}
            {'
                {enterOver 11.0 0.5 write}
                {hold 11.5 13.0 {^ {t f} {crossParts t f {' "sum"} weightColor}}}
                {exitOver 12.6 0.4 fadeOut}}}}]


Fn([List({brings: Float, share: Float}), List({brings: Float, share: Float})], Score). P's lights as a score of 14
steps: the bars of f and p, a draw and its estimate, the line of estimates as p follows f, mixing two ways of
drawing, the ideal p as the target, and the cheap choice the lab starts from.
$[# {_score atP atQ}
    [# n {length atP}]
    [# shares {map atP .share}]
    [# total {fold {map atP .brings} 0.0 +}]
    [# unit {/ {fold {map atP .brings} 0.000001 max} {max {lightIntensity} 0.01}}]
    [# {_brings s}
        [# toQ {smooth {phase s 12.0 12.6}}]
        {map {zip atP atQ} {^ {e} {lerp {.brings {.first e}} {.brings {.second e}} toQ}}}]
    [# {_ideal s} {- {smooth {phase s 6.0 6.6}} {smooth {phase s 11.5 12.0}}}]
    [# {_pNow s}
        [# toF {+ {- {smooth {phase s 3.0 3.7}} {smooth {phase s 4.0 4.6}}} {_ideal s}}]
        [# brings {_brings s}]
        {map {zip shares brings} {^ {e} {lerp {.first e} {over {.second e} total} toF}}}]
    [# l {: {.
        n n
        shares shares
        total total
        draws {map {range 0 _draws} {^ {j} {_pick shares {uniform 11 j}}}}
        brings _brings
        pNow _pNow
        ideal _ideal
        fHeight {^ {f} {min 2.6 {* 1.8 {/ f unit}}}}
        pHeight {^ {s p} {* 1.6 {/ p {fold {_pNow s} 0.000001 max}}}}} _Lights}]
    [# {_pBars s}
        [# pNow {_pNow s}]
        [# top {fold pNow 0.000001 max}]
        {flatten {map
            {zip {range 0 n} pNow}
            {^ {e} {_bar f"{p${str {.first e}}}"
                {.first e}
                n
                _pBase
                {* 1.6 {/ {.second e} top}}
                pColor
                0.85}}}}]
    [# {_fBars s}
        [# brings {_brings s}]
        {flatten {map
            {zip {range 0 n} brings}
            {^ {e} {_bar f"{f${str {.first e}}}"
                {.first e}
                n
                _fBase
                {{.fHeight l} {.second e}}
                targetColor
                0.85}}}}]
    [# {_label latex} {moveTo {tex "fLabel" latex 0.5 targetColor} {v2 -6.75 {+ _fBase 0.9}}}]
    [# {_where caption x} {moveTo caption {v2 x 3.75}}]
    [# barsNote {moveTo
        {caption "barsNote" {textKey "lightsmath-bars"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 -1.7 {- _pBase 0.5}}}]
    {score "is" 14
        {flatten {'
            {'
                {part "fBars" _fBars {' {enterOver 0.0 0.5 growUp}}}
                {part "pBars"
                    {^ {s} {faded {_pBars s} {- 1.0 {_ideal s}}}}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 0.2 0.5 growUp}
                        {emphasize 13.0 14.0 {^ {t f} {circumscribe t f accentColor}}}}}
                {part "idealBars"
                    {^ {s} {faded {tinted {_pBars s} targetColor} {* 0.9 {_ideal s}}}}
                    {'}}
                {part "fLabel"
                    {^ {s} {_label "f"}}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 0.0 0.4 fadeIn}
                        {emphasize 8.0 9.0 {^ {t f} {indicate t f accentColor}}}
                        {becomeOver 9.0 0.6 {^ {s} {_label f"{\hat p}"}}}}}
                {part "pLabel"
                    {^ {s} {moveTo {tex "pLabel" "p" 0.5 pColor} {v2 -6.75 {+ _pBase 0.8}}}}
                    {' {enterOver 0.0 0.4 fadeIn}}}
                {part "whereP"
                    {^ {s} {_where
                        {caption "whereP" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-p"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                        -5.4}}
                    {'
                        {enterOver 0.0 0.4 fadeIn}
                        {becomeOver 12.0 0.6 {^ {s} {_where
                            {caption "whereP" {textKey "lightsmath-pixel-q"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                            -4.6}}}}}
                {part "barsNote" {^ {s} barsNote} {' {enterOver 0.0 0.4 fadeIn}}}}
            {_drawnParts l}
            {_estimateParts l}
            {_mixingParts l}
            {_targetParts total}}}
        {'}}]


The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). P's lights at stage its stage (`stepOf "is" 14`, the clips below).
$[# lightsMath {: {^ {t} {playScore {_score
    {exampleLights 0 {lightPhase} {lightIntensity}}
    {exampleLights 1 {lightPhase} {lightIntensity}}}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each,
and moves the lights as the story does in steps 7 and 8 (their phase and power); the story plays each step over
its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# isSteps [% {together {'
    {stepsInOrder "is" 14}
    {clip {'
        {keys "lightPhase" {'
            {keyframe 0.0 0.0 "linear"}
            {keyframe 6.0 0.0 "linear"}
            {keyframe 7.0 0.03 "smooth"}
            {keyframe 7.5 0.03 "linear"}
            {keyframe 8.0 0.05 "smooth"}}}
        {keys "lightIntensity" {'
            {keyframe 0.0 1.0 "linear"}
            {keyframe 7.0 1.0 "linear"}
            {keyframe 7.5 1.5 "smooth"}}}}}}}]]
$[# isAt0 [% {stepsAt "is" 14 0}]]
$[# isAt6 [% {stepsAt "is" 14 6}]]
$[# isStep1 [% {stepClip "is" 1 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep10 [% {stepClip "is" 10 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep11 [% {stepClip "is" 11 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep12 [% {stepClip "is" 12 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep13 [% {stepClip "is" 13 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep14 [% {stepClip "is" 14 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep2 [% {stepClip "is" 2 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep3 [% {stepClip "is" 3 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep4 [% {stepClip "is" 4 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep5 [% {stepClip "is" 5 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep6 [% {stepClip "is" 6 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep7 [% {stepClip "is" 7 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# isStep8From0To50 [% {stepClip "is" 8 0.0 0.5}]]
$[# isStep8From50To100 [% {stepClip "is" 8 0.5 1.0}]]
$[# isStep9 [% {stepClip "is" 9 0.0 1.0}]]
